      "summary": "GauXC is a modern, modular C++ library for the evaluation of quantities related to the exchange-correlation (XC) energy (e.g. potential, etc) in the Gaussian basis set discretization of Kohn-Sham density function theory (KS-DFT) on heterogenous architectures."
    },
